{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23428","headline":"苦热中寄舒员外 · 白居易","name":"苦热中寄舒员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何堪日衰病，复此时炎燠。\n厌对俗杯盘，倦听凡丝竹。\n藤牀铺晚雪，角枕截寒玉。\n安得清瘦人，新秋夜同宿。\n非君固不可，何夕枉高躅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23428.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23428","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}